<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian holidays for 1996.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian holidays for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are scheduled Australian holidays for the rest of 1996.</p>
<p>    Mon 30 Sep  Queen's Birthday (public holiday in WA)</p>
<p>    Mon  7 Oct  Labour Day	 (public/market ACT, NSW, SA)</p>
<p>    Tues 5 Nov  Melbourne Cup    (public holiday in Melb only)</p>
<p>    Wed 25 Dec  Christmas Day    (public and market holiday)</p>
<p>    Thu 26 Dec  Boxing Day	 (public and market holiday)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
